                            "value": "1 flying creature"
                          },
                          "description": {
                            "value": "Using the weight of earth, you hamper a target's flight, with effects based on its Fortitude save. If the creature reaches the ground safely, it doesn't take falling damage.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target falls safely up to 120 feet.\n- **Failure:** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 minute."
                          },
